{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/b77260143ba6fabb3a7acd848723840a.poster.avif?t=1767678923\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/b77260143ba6fabb3a7acd848723840a.webm?t=1767678923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/b77260143ba6fabb3a7acd848723840a.mp4?t=1767678923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;PomoTrain: Rabbit Town&gt;\u00a0</strong>is an idle game with built-in Pomodoro features where you become the conductor of a cute rabbit village, growing and customizing both the town and the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of ambient sounds and background music are provided, and you can also upload your own favorite tracks or listen through YouTube integration within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, step into the role of the rabbit village\u2019s conductor and set off on a journey together with your train!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train Journey with Adorable Rabbit Residents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/322fb92c71bbc52914f4c5aae3abf606.poster.avif?t=1767678923\" width=878 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/322fb92c71bbc52914f4c5aae3abf606.webm?t=1767678923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/322fb92c71bbc52914f4c5aae3abf606.mp4?t=1767678923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive the train, collect hearts, and meet various rabbit residents. Adorable rabbits are ready to welcome you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Google Calendar Integration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/2ed08f5c95fe73325516f96012bfe2b4.poster.avif?t=1767678923\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/2ed08f5c95fe73325516f96012bfe2b4.webm?t=1767678923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/2ed08f5c95fe73325516f96012bfe2b4.mp4?t=1767678923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Manage your schedule effortlessly by syncing with Google Calendar. Your in-game calendar and Google Calendar work seamlessly together, allowing you to view your entire schedule at a glance. You can also use the To-Do list to record and efficiently manage your daily tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train That Grows with You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/412b3fa95b0309e949f0318fa3ba42c3.poster.avif?t=1767678923\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/412b3fa95b0309e949f0318fa3ba42c3.webm?t=1767678923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/412b3fa95b0309e949f0318fa3ba42c3.mp4?t=1767678923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your focus and effort build up, the gold earned through Pomodoro sessions drives the train forward and brings the village to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Music Settings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/d7a6987dd34b1123aa9c0b6ce4dbcdf8.poster.avif?t=1767678923\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/d7a6987dd34b1123aa9c0b6ce4dbcdf8.webm?t=1767678923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/d7a6987dd34b1123aa9c0b6ce4dbcdf8.mp4?t=1767678923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the perfect soundtrack for your work sessions. Enhance your immersion with in-game BGM, or upload your own music and link YouTube to enjoy your personal playlists.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Whistle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/d299dbba12536cb2176eb27c4944bee08abe056a.jpg"},{"name":"Warming Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/a5cbee24d955dd0596a64c640e2107966b8a81dd.jpg"},{"name":"Departure!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/1a6a87bfa719068f88dca672dfb2b0e097889184.jpg"},{"name":"Diligent Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/a0e374847d09e350e1b7c5ecf3400c854bb537f5.jpg"},{"name":"Joy of Immersion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/b578f5516e08f8f2a9d71241b0ff8984120d0c11.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Will","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3969190/672d